            "text": "For most people, a well-made blend of whey isolate and concentrate offers the best balance of price, protein per scoop and taste. Optimum Nutrition Gold Standard 100% Whey is our top pick because its label lists isolate first, it delivers about 24 g of protein per scoop and it is promoted as Informed Choice certified. Confirm the flavor in the certifier database."
          }
