          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does hydrolyzed whey work better than regular whey?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It digests slightly faster, but studies at matched doses have not shown meaningful differences in long-term muscle or strength gains. Intact whey is already very fast. Hydrolyzed whey makes sense if ordinary whey and isolate both upset your stomach, or if you want the lightest option between same-day sessions. Otherwise it is a premium you do not need to pay."
          }
        },
