          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is whey protein safe to take every day?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "For healthy adults, daily whey within a sensible total protein intake is well studied and generally considered safe. Choose a third-party tested product to reduce contamination risk. People with kidney disease, people who are pregnant or breastfeeding, and anyone on medication affecting kidney function should speak with a doctor or registered dietitian first. Avoid whey entirely if you have a milk allergy."
          }
