          <a href="#blends" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Why Blends Win on Value</a>
          <a href="#grass-fed" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Grass-Fed Claims</a>
          <a href="#hydrolyzed" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. Hydrolyzed Whey</a>
          <a href="#gain-muscle" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">9. Whey to Gain Muscle</a>
